<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panamerican started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said on Tuesday it had started its coverage of Panamerican Beverages Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Lucrecia Tam wrote in a report that the company's earnings per share should grow an average 21 percent in the 1996-98 period.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our price target is $55 per share (25 percent upside) in the next 12 months,&quot; she wrote.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
</text>
